# hachimaki-dev — Windsurf Rules

## Project
Personal website: React 18 + Vite + CSS native + Supabase. Single admin. GitHub Pages deploy.

## Critical Rules
- JavaScript ONLY — no TypeScript (.ts/.tsx)
- CSS variables ONLY from `src/styles/tokens.css` — never hardcode colors/sizes/fonts
- NO CSS frameworks (Tailwind, Bootstrap, etc.)
- Import Supabase client from `src/lib/supabase.js` ONLY — never create new instances
- NO localStorage for business data — only Supabase
- Handle loading + error + empty states in every async component
- Use `useToast()` for user feedback
- Migrations go in `migrations/NNN_desc.sql` (local, gitignored)
- kebab-case CSS classes, PascalCase components, camelCase hooks/utils
- Unit tests exist in `__tests__` directories, run via `npm test`

